  27: The hypothesis leaves protein synthesis, receptor kinetics, post-learning consolidation, real visual-KC normalization and long biological retention unresolved. A pass would identify a computational route worth testing, not satisfy the full biological research goal. The Eyes-to-KC rank relay remains a substantial external engineering approximation.
