research/project/decision_log.md:708:Implemented repeated current-error selection, exact informative-sequence controls, equal-dose fixed-target comparison, stored reference/proof evidence, streamed independent audit and verified disk resume. 215 software tests pass; 760 frame updates and 130 final graph rows audit. Useful acquisition fails; adaptive margin advantage passes. No solved-plasticity, biological-retention, reversal or transfer claim. PAM02 pulse-only proposal was deferred after zero direct overlap between its eligible cells and current cues. Earlier baseline-mask causal wording and unverified test-pass claims are corrected. Previous failed shared-memory patch made no code change. Current-status has preexisting invalid UTF-8; this native append preserves original bytes.
research/project/decision_log.md:762:Implement optional Nova v3b alongside Stockfish so the project can compare policies, but do not combine the opponent scales. Nova's raw checkpoint omits the hosted strength-calibration/filter stage, so its 800-2700 input is not a rating reference; the stopped nominal Stockfish-setting estimate cannot be translated. Downloading pinned research weights and wiring the adapter is not an Elo result. Native ONNX Runtime failed to load on Windows, so dependency integration pivoted to single-thread WASM; inference and memory remain unverified. User reserved CPU for another agent, so do not start a graph, Nova inference or match until that work is clear. [Source/scale/runtime record](../../documentation/design/evaluation-and-performance/flybench.md#2026-10-10-nova-raw-policy-integration).
research/project/decision_log.md:768:Registered zero-reset v1 preserves exact state and scores but fails the black-after-e4 latency median/p95 gate. Do not adopt from three improving fixtures or a lower aggregate median. Preserve failed sources/protocol/raw results. Forward recurrence remains dominant; coefficient caching would target roughly one millisecond of a roughly 200-millisecond pass in historical phase evidence. No local native compiler/assembler is installed. Test a small built-in WebAssembly accumulation kernel with unchanged edge summation order, double-precision accumulation, full activity buffers, refreshed input copies and bounded scratch memory. This is an engineering backend hypothesis, not a biological pathway or learned-policy substitute. Register source provenance and a new fixed comparison before graph use. [Failed before](../../archive/early-development/research/reports/move-latency-zero-reset-2026-10-10/README.md); [record](../journal/experiments/2026-10-10-move-latency-zero-reset.md).
research/project/decision_log.md:797:The researcher chooses meaningful learned evaluation first. Current browser scores are untrained; the mapped puzzle adapter has no calibrated position value, and the latest gamma2 informative run improves local association but fails useful ranking. Investigate a fixed reference-relative identified MBON readout as a separate engineering hypothesis, with unchanged endogenous memory and certificate-bound informative/absent/matched-shuffled/disabled conditions. Preserve raw readout failures and latency results. Do not fit a decoder to old outcomes, substitute an engine policy, or claim learning from software plumbing. [Dated scope and hypothesis record](../journal/experiments/2026-10-10-consequence-value-readout.md).
research/project/decision_log.md:805:2026-10-10 verification completion: full archived-source replay passes 304 frames/16 lessons and exact ranking/memory interventions, while reproducing the frozen changed-board failure. Keep browser adoption rejected and preserve the adverse raw-readout comparison. No new graph study or decoder fitting follows from the probes. Any later representation comparison needs new preregistration, informative certified feedback, matched exposure/current controls and independently checked unfamiliar/counterfactual gates. [Verification](../../archive/early-development/research/reports/consequence-value-feasibility-v1-2026-10-10/verification.json).
