research/project/decision_log.md:1089:Wait-capable independent replay passed over all24 stages,14,161 receipts and15,481 presentations; audit hash `bdc2213e459ea7765032db26a29bb9ab9743bcc628787fdca7a38d669209d23d`. Retained branch fails contextAdvantage and marginAdvantage (informative7/8 tied shuffled-20261011 7/8; margin lower), while reset passes all descriptive gates (informative8/8 versus controls at most6/8). This confirms the predeclared `history-dependent limitation in this configuration` interpretation for projection seed20261011 only. It cannot pass G0, identify the responsible memory component or authorize C01. Shuffle-seed variability (retained7/4/4; reset5/5/3) means the single-shuffle original failure must not be retold as a broad specificity defect, and no weaker shuffle is adopted. Next: register a serial feedback-enabled replication of the retained/reset diagnostic on effective projection seeds20261012 and20261013, then choose a component-targeted or mainline hypothesis from the audited outcome. Original gates, frozen sources and final families unchanged.
